{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"lines-of-action UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"fr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"lines-of-action.copy.howAnswer","keys":["lines-of-action.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"fr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Déplacez une pièce exactement au nombre de cases occupées sur sa ligne, sa colonne ou sa diagonale. Vous pouvez sauter vos propres pièces, capturer un adversaire en atterrissant dessus, et devez former un groupe connecté. Les Noirs se déplacent en premier. Choisissez la règle de connexion simultanée avant de commencer.","record_id":"ac9eb4c61ce3ef0844fd1145bda2701a3dd98e37631b1b9aaa1a0dbef9abeb74","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40523422271","seconds":4.839393976875044,"source":"Move a piece exactly the number of occupied squares on its full row, column or diagonal. You may jump your own pieces, capture an opponent by landing on it, and must form one connected group. Black moves first. Choose the simultaneous-connection rule before starting.","source_commit":"65626e5376c5d623fb48ed0c157c91316f836307","source_hash":"21f20bb069113843c8bec9dca033940a317c04a393e31482c7db7b5495251c4e","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Déplacez une pièce exactement au nombre de cases occupées sur sa ligne, sa colonne ou sa diagonale. Vous pouvez sauter vos propres pièces, capturer un adversaire en atterrissant dessus, et devez former un groupe connecté. Les Noirs se déplacent en premier. Choisissez la règle de connexion simultanée avant de commencer.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
