{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"panchang-calendar UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"fr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"panchang-calendar.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["panchang-calendar.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"fr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Un instantané astronomique approximatif, pas un calendrier officiel Panchang ou festival / muhurta. Il utilise une approximation linéaire Lahiri ayanamsa et une convention de lever du soleil. Les calendriers régionaux, les éphémérides, l'élévation, la réfraction et les limites de la lumière du jour peuvent différer.","record_id":"ac13793cd530ea369ccd8be50becd9dcb3b6dd721076a4e1a857b616026410f9","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40523422271","seconds":1.9863190628749976,"source":"An approximate astronomical snapshot, not an official Panchang or festival/muhurta calendar. It uses a linear Lahiri ayanamsa approximation and one sunrise convention. Regional calendars, ephemerides, elevation, refraction and daylight boundaries may differ. It does not determine holidays, observances, auspicious times or religious guidance. Compare results with a regional Panchang.","source_commit":"65626e5376c5d623fb48ed0c157c91316f836307","source_hash":"6bbe1f6cbd14dcdd3cdc836d0ae08e460167c491c1670e51b847d7ae664a430e","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Un instantané astronomique approximatif, pas un calendrier officiel Panchang ou festival / muhurta. Il utilise une approximation linéaire Lahiri ayanamsa et une convention de lever du soleil. Les calendriers régionaux, les éphémérides, l'élévation, la réfraction et les limites de la lumière du jour peuvent différer.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
